519
00:36:53.428 --> 00:36:55.952
Um. no. I’m sorry. Eddie.
That’s not how this works.

520
00:36:56.126 --> 00:36:57.476
But I’m in no hurry. you know.

521
00:36:57.650 --> 00:36:59.391
I’m just fine and
dandy sitting here

522
