Did you know that?

526
00:37:08.313 --> 00:37:09.531
Something to look forward to.

527
00:37:09.705 --> 00:37:11.446
Eddie Barrish.

528
00:37:11.620 --> 00:37:14.362
Eddie Barrish. thank you. And
