home again. Eddie.

553
00:39:43.859 --> 00:39:45.165
That’s life’s tragedy.

554
00:39:45.339 --> 00:39:48.821
How do you pick up the
threads of an old life?

555
00:39:48.995 --> 00:39:50.605
How do you go on?

556
