610
00:43:33.654 --> 00:43:34.655
Come on.

611
00:43:39.573 --> 00:43:40.661
Come on.

612
00:43:48.190 --> 00:43:49.757
Come on. Eddie. Come on.

613
00:43:53.892 --> 00:43:56.068
God! Fuck. you’re
tasing my heart. man!

