695
00:52:49.644 --> 00:52:51.429
Good. then let’s
have some anarchy.

696
00:52:58.740 --> 00:53:00.089
Stop. stop!

697
00:53:00.264 --> 00:53:01.743
But I don’t want to stop.

698
00:53:01.917 --> 00:53:04.311
If there are no rules.
then why should I?

699
00:53:09.751 --> 00:53:11.536
He’s a gangster.
a virus. a leech.

700
00:53:11.710 --> 00:53:13.230
