up all the way.

709
00:53:38.302 --> 00:53:39.303
That’s the deal.

710
00:53:41.609 --> 00:53:43.872
Come on. get up.

711
00:53:48.399 --> 00:53:50.879
Come on. Come on.
come on. get up.

712
00:53:56.233 --> 00:53:58.452
You fucking motherfucker!

713
00:53:58.626 --> 00:54:00.976
You fucking psycho. I’m
