723
00:54:36.621 --> 00:54:39.058
Chaos. revolution. yeah!

724
00:54:40.277 --> 00:54:41.321
Whoa!

725
00:54:45.064 --> 00:54:46.370
Stop!

726
00:54:46.544 --> 00:54:48.372
Come on. Eddie... Fuck! Fuck!

727
00:54:48.546 --> 00:54:50.546
